---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <div style="max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <span style="color: var(--color-primary);">Cognivo</span>
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: #6b7280; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;">
      AI-native component library with cognitive psychology integration. 125 Web Components, 1,800+ design tokens, streaming generative UI, and 184 cognitive biases.
    </p>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
      <a href="/getting-started" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;">Get Started</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/muriloscigliano/cognivo" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; color: var(--color-text);">GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; text-align: left;">
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">10 Packages</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">Core, components, design tokens, gen-ui, gen-ui-lit, OpenAI adapter, React wrapper, Vue wrapper, design advisor, and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">125 Components</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">52 foundation components (forms, data, navigation, overlays) plus 73 AI-native components for streaming generative UI.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">1,800+ Tokens</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">3-tier design token system with palette generator, semantic layers, and full dark mode support via CSS custom properties.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">842 Tests</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">Comprehensive test coverage across all packages with Vitest, ensuring reliability for production use.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">12 AI Patterns</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">Guardrails, resilience, caching, routing, conversation, circuit breaker, self-refine, extended thinking, agent coordination, and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">184 Cognitive Biases</h3>
        <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem;">Comprehensive bias library with design implications, examples, and implementation guidance for every bias.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
